			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Mountain and Cocoon changes\n\nRoutine submodule synchronization bringing in latest changes across the application stack:\n1. Mountain:\n   - Implement FileSystemProvider::Copy for directories with iterative stack-based recursive copy, symlink handling, and self-copy prevention\n   - Implement WorkspaceEditApplier::ApplyWorkspaceEdit with two-tier approach: emit editor events for open documents, apply directly to disk for closed files\n   - Revert binary/lib naming to verbose development identifier for build continuity\n   - BREAKING CHANGE: Binary and lib names changed from \"Mountain\" to \"DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_ElectronProfile_Mountain\"\n2. Cocoon: Submodule sync to latest extension host changes.\n\nImpact: Mountain now supports directory copies and workspace edit application, enabling more VS Code extension APIs. Extension host updated to latest.",
