			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with latest Cocoon and Output artifacts\n\nUpdate Element submodule from 6a4ea120 to 6cf23bcb, bringing in the latest Cocoon extension host and Output bundled JS artifacts.\n\nThis routine sync pulls in the newest changes from the Cocoon extension host (which interfaces with Mountain via gRPC to run VS Code extensions) and the Output submodule containing bundled JavaScript from the Rest element consumed by Cocoon at runtime.",
